Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:11.19,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:55.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:58.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:00:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die\Non your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:04.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:22.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you think of the current situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.80,Sign,,0,0,400,,For Micromachining Use
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:06.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their response was quicker\Nthan I had expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:09.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're not idiots; they know\Nhow serious the situation is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:15.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We usually have a long wait at this stage, while the\Npolice are carrying out anti-terrorism operations...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:31.21,Sign - Copy,,500,0,500,,REBOOT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:41.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everyone, prepare for\Ncyberbrain infiltration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:45.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Also, make sure to set up\Nfirewalls to circumvent detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:03:01.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Twenty-three minutes ago, an armed group seized control of\Nthe Chinese Embassy on this building's forty-sixth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While the actual number of\Nhostages is unclear at this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:10.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it has been confirmed that there were at least ten\Nemployees in the Embassy when it was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:12.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The precise number of\Nterrorists is also unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:17.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Although I hesitate to rely heavily on their\Nstatements to provide an accurate count,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:22.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they claimed responsibility for the\Naction as the "Individual Eleven".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:26.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, they've barricaded\Nthemselves within the Embassy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:30.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That means that Section 9 is released\Nfrom the indefinite standby order.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:35.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, although we can't be certain until\Nwe receive an official order to sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:39.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In any case, what do the\N"Individual Eleven" demand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.45,0:03:42.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Immediate revocation of immigration\Nprivileges for Asian refugees
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:47.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and a complete shutdown of the five residential\Nrefugee relief sectors scattered across the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:51.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Those demands can't be complied with\Nquickly; is this some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:57.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, the Chinese government\Nprovides a regular flight to Dejima
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.23,0:03:59.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in order to avoid accepting the\Nrecent flood of Asian refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:02.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess the Embassy was\Nchosen because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.23,0:04:04.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That would be my conclusion if we\Ntake the evidence at face value.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:08.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, we cannot do so, as long as\Nwe do not know their true intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:13.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I tapped into the facility's\Nnetwork as soon as I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What does the police's plan look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:18.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition to censoring the media, they seem\Nto have initiated communication jamming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Radio transmissions are being blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm also detecting interference\Nin inter-cyberbrain transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:26.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the security cameras inside\Nthe building have been disabled;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:31.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the terrorists are conducting negotiations\Nwith the police over a voice-only feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:35.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that. Once you've tapped that\Nline, get back to the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.93,0:04:36.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:37.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:40.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have arrived at the target area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:46.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The building's windows are visually screened;\NI am unable to confirm the situation inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.11,0:04:49.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will prioritise the\Nneutralisation of the curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that.\NThe rest of you, prepare for assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:55.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll wait for the order from the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:05:01.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the Chief is unable to persuade\Nthe leadership to let us go,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:05.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we'll halt our surveillance, retreat from the\Nbuilding, and go get smashed at a strip club!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:11.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The problem is the\Ntiming of this terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:17.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Along with the upcoming repeal of\Nthe Refugee Special Treatment Act,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:21.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we had intended to announce, at the repeal address,\Nthe indefinite suspension of refugee immigration
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:27.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,along with a step-wise reduction of\Nthe residential refugee relief sectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:32.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since it is arguably the first major\Npost-war change in policy towards refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:36.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you wish to avoid, at any cost, having the populace believe\Nthat the government succumbed to terrorist demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:42.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thus, you must subdue the terrorists\Nbefore the media learns their demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:48.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It would seem that such considerations could\Nbe the reason for summoning me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:52.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The rumours about your\Nintelligence appear to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:54.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let us not waste time with idle praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:56.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The situation demands expediency.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:01.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:08.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I believe I can request that funds for rebuilding Section\N9 be included in the budget at the next Dietary Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:14.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, there must be zero\Ncasualties among the current hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:16.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is an absolute requirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:21.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will make your condition a reality as\Nsoon as you allow me to order the assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Calm down, Aramaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:28.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We are currently in the process of\Ncontacting the relevant agencies
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:31.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and having them sign documents approving the\Nrevision of the Special Forces Control Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:34.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The drafting of the\Ndocuments, starting now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:36.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you believe we have\Nthat kind of leeway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:41.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if the mission succeeds,\Nif Section 9 acts without proper approval,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:43.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it will be crucified by the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:47.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not much time has passed since the fiasco which\Nincluded Section 9's dissolution, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:54.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unless our request to provisionally revise the bill\Nfinds enough support, you don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:58.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unfortunately,\Nthe Minister of the Interior is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:02.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You must wait until the necessary\Ndocuments have been prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:07.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:11.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:17.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit, I feel like we should become\Nterrorists and go after this pansy Cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:22.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Terrorist: unauthorised armed organisations\Nthat mobilise without knowledge of the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:26.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just look at the facts,\Nwe're already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:35.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Kayabuki Cabinet, which replaced\Nthe so-called Yakushima regime,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:40.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is said to be a conservative regime that is a reaction\Nagainst the post-war democratic track, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I recall, the step-wise dismantling\Nof the current refugee policy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:48.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,was a promise the Prime Minister\Nmade in his inaugural address.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:52.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A policy similar to what the terrorists are currently\Ndemanding would've been implemented even if they didn't act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:58.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While refugees were useful as a source of cheap\Nlabour in the post-war reconstruction era,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:08:02.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,now the domestic unemployment rate continues to increase\Nevery year, while tax rates continue to escalate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:06.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Consider also the wanton use of taxpayer\Nmoney to fund the current policy towards
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:08.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,refugees, who continue to\Nstream into the nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:12.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and it's not too difficult to see\Nwhy restless elements have appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:18.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When all is said and done, it is the taxpayer who has been\Nsaddled with the cost of accepting and aiding refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:22.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,which was a ploy by the government to maintain\Na good image in the international community.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Actually,\Nsome of the refugees are taxpayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:34.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, I suppose this means the point of view wherein we\Nsuffer heavy taxation in order to support these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who could very well take our employment opportunities,\Nhas come to prevail amongst the general populace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:40.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even so, it's pretty myopic of\Nthem to turn directly to terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:46.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For that matter, it's also nearsighted\Nthat after being forcibly disbanded,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:52.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we get called out the minute there's\Na case that the police can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:09:00.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Chief must be having an audience with the new\Nregime's power brokers by now. He's probably seething.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:04.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To think that the Minister of Interior\Ngot away without any reprimand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:11.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At present, the Ministry of the Interior itself only\Nserves as a cushion for domestic government agencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.02,0:09:18.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That the Minister hasn't been replaced is basically\Nproof that no one sees him as a threat, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:21.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Until now, that fact has\Nbeen a shield for Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:30.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By the way, have you heard that we'll get a few new\Nrecruits, in the event that we succeed in this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:32.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,New recruits?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:40.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, while it may not be my place to say this, I find it\Nhard to believe that there are many who could keep up with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:49.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, it's only going to be an issue if\Nwe can accomplish this mission as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, I have neutralised\Nthe visual curtains,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but they are using blinds as\Nan additional obstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:57.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems like they know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:02.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Set up a bypass in the\Nphone line you've tapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:06.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll use the eyes of those\Ninside to see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:07.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that; leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:51.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, we've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:02.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hm, that was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.67,0:11:03.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It wasn't from the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:22.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Heh, sending in scouts...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:51.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems like they want to\Nspeed up the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.39,0:11:56.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've lost contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:06.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There are nine terrorists in total?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:11.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who is the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:19.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This guy... he's all flesh\Naside from his cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:33.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prime Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:34.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:35.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We are in a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:38.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We received a call from the Embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:43.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it appears that there's been contact between the police\Nand the terrorists; both sides have incurred casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:46.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They had orders not to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it appears that the shootout occurred\Ninadvertently while they were attempting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:52.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to gather intelligence inside the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:56.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To make matters worse,\None policewoman was taken hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the terrorists have announced that\Nthey will first execute the policeman
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and then the hostages one by\None at ten-minute intervals
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:04.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,unless you publicly announce within an hour\Nthat you will acquiesce to their demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, the incident has needlessly\Nexacerbated the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:13.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We do not have time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:17.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Make a decision! Let me act with the\Nflexibility that the situation now demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:21.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The media censorship will\Nnot last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:26.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If anyone post on the local guerrilla\Nnetwork and starts a thread,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:28.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the current strategy will lose all meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:31.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are the documents still not prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:33.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prime Minister, allow me to give\Nyou an alternate perspective:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:44.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,this terrorist attack can only be\Nresolved by a paramilitary assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:47.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we do not stray from this scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:50.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is it not possible for you to order an\Nassault, based on your personal authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:56.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will carry out our operation in\Nsecret under the guise of the SWAT team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:04.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,During our operation, however, you will have to prepare the\Ndocumentation necessary to justify our actions after the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.33,0:14:10.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can promise you that; however,\Nwhat if you fail to subdue the terrorists?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:19.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I assure you that we will succeed, but we\Ncan only prove it to you if you trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:24.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you still cannot cast aside your doubts, you\Nmay say that all subsequent actions by Section 9
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:29.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,were undertaken at my own command.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:32.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, only I will need to be placed\Non trial in the worst case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:38.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, even if the public were to seek blame in the\Ngovernment, no one is aware of Section 9's actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.97,0:14:40.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But, Prime Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:51.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Minister, I would like you to contact\Nthe Police Inspector-General immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.03,0:14:54.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:57.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something has been set in motion, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:02.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Exactly fifteen minutes from now, the SWAT\Nteam will initiate an assault on the Embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:07.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Before that happens, infiltrate the\NEmbassy and immobilise the terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:10.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you must, you are\Nauthorised to use lethal force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:13.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rescuing the hostages\Nis our highest priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:16.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I leave the assault team selection to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:17.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fifteen minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:21.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You say it so casually,\Nafter making us wait for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:24.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou, bring the chopper back for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, everyone, you heard the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:31.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You've seen what it's like inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:34.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There are nine terrorists,\None of whom is now dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:37.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Memorise the building's structural layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:41.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At most, we have ten minutes\Nto carry out our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:46.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Think of the short time period we've been given\Nas an indication of the Chief's faith in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:47.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:00.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who's going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:04.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, you're with Togusa;\NPazu, you're with Saitou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:06.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll infiltrate the Embassy via a\Ndifferent route than the SWAT team...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:12.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Right up front, using the elevators.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You two pairs go ahead;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:16.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we'll follow after making\Npreliminary preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:29.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An assault in fifteen minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.37,0:16:33.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We don't even have a clear picture of\Nthe inside; what is the brass thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:41.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are the other assault routes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:47.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The rooftop... and the fire escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:51.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's move half of the\Nhostages to the fire escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:53.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:57.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What a strange group...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:17:00.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They take care of tactical\Nrequirements without any leadership,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:01.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but they don't have organisation, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:05.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm also unable to find substantial\Ninformation on the group,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:08.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,despite the fact that this one's\Ncyberbrain has no firewall to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:10.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.43,0:17:15.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, we're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:17.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, I'll draw their\Nattention until the last second,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:18.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and then make them attack each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:21.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After that, each of you will be\Non your own to hit your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:22.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Make absolutely sure\Nnot to hit any hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:27.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stay standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An elevator is moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:37.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Keep watch of the hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.62,0:17:50.12,Sign,,600,0,900,,{\fs60}Consular Section of the Chinese Embassy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:52.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's your-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.65,0:17:56.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the hell do you think you're-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:13.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, you missed one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:15.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:31.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're going in early!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.31,0:18:41.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey you, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:04.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:44.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, where are the others-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:59.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, the SWAT team came in early!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:06.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit, the SWAT team's in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:16.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We are the Individual Eleven!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:21.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if we are to perish here, particularist\Negos will carry on our ideals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:24.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As such, death has no meaning for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:25.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Die, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Outside the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:48.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You've done very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:52.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The proposed budget has\Nbeen fully accepted;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:55.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we hereby authorise you\Nto reconstruct Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.01,0:20:57.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These are the documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:20:59.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:02.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you the Major who took\Ncharge of the assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:09.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, it's not like you to not\Nmake even a single sarcastic remark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:11.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Was that because the\NPrime Minister is a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:15.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She is not the one towards whom\Nverbal abuse should be directed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.57,0:21:18.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, I haven't heard of anyone getting\Nindigestion because they swallowed a sarcastic
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:21.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,remark they would've otherwise spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't having a leader like\Nher going to be trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:27.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She's the type to want a leash on her dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:35.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, it appears she used the assault order to get\Nyou to do what she wanted, while avoiding responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.74,0:21:40.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Indeed, she does not seem to be mere figurehead\Nthat the ruling coalition initially produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:46.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For now, let's just be happy\Nthat Section 9 was reinstated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.65,0:21:48.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, you're late.\NDid the requested budget go through?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:56.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fully and completely!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:59.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Togusa, you did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:00.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your marksmanship has improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:03.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:07.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now I guess you don't have to be humiliated\Nif new, sharp-shooting members join.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:10.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, yeah. So what about these new recruits?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.51,0:22:13.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, allow me to introduce them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:14.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:28.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}Nice to meet you.... I am Tachikoma.....{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:31.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.22,0:22:43.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Boo! I was just kidding, Batou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.71,0:22:45.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were you surprised? Say yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.27,0:22:52.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We reconstructed the Tachikoma who've\Nundergone structural analysis at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:54.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From now on, they're part of Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.57,0:22:55.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.09,0:22:58.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're looking forward to\Nworking with you, Batou-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:12.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:16.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:19.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:22.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:26.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:30.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:34.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:36.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:37.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:39.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:39.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.65,0:23:41.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:42.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:43.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:44.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:45.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:46.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.16,0:23:47.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.76,0:23:48.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:51.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.40,0:23:51.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:52.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:53.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.41,0:23:55.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:56.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:23:59.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:00.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:02.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.17,0:24:03.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:04.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:05.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:06.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:08.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.13,0:24:12.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside, (the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.79,0:24:13.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\NI see inside, (the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.19,0:24:15.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.27,0:24:17.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.57,0:24:17.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:18.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.82,0:24:22.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:22.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside\Nto make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:23.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:28.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
